              "help": {
                "markdown": "## Details\n\nSome JSON Web Token (JWT) signature verification methods (i.e. expiration, not before) have been explicitly disabled. The application will therefore accept JWT tokens which fail these checks, which may provide an attacker with greater opportunity to forge or re-use JWT tokens for the application.\n\n### Best practices for prevention\n\n- Enforce verification of the 'expiration' claim of the JWT\n- Enforce verification of the 'not before' claim of the JWT\n\n## Best practices for prevention\n* [JWT Validation](https://auth0.com/docs/secure/tokens/json-web-tokens/validate-json-web-tokens)",
                "text": ""
              },
